  "body": "An international-sized floodlit tennis court sets this exceptional Paritai Drive estate apart. Occupying nearly half an acre in one of Auckland's most coveted addresses, the property delivers a lifestyle rarely available in the city. This is more than a substantial residence; it is a private resort where sport, wellness and hospitality come together in one exceptional setting, creating an environment equally suited to family life, entertaining and recreation. \r\n\r\nDesigned by acclaimed architect Richard Priest, this remarkable estate combines world-class amenities with striking contemporary architecture. At its heart, the international-sized floodlit tennis court creates a unique focal point, seamlessly connected to the home's living and entertaining spaces and providing an extraordinary backdrop for family enjoyment, social occasions and active living. \r\nSpanning approximately 654 sq m, the residence has been crafted to capture spectacular harbour views, abundant natural light and exceptional privacy. Expansive living and dining areas flow effortlessly to outdoor terraces, while the infinity pool appears to float above Paritai Drive, framing breathtaking views across the harbour, city skyline and Rangitoto. \r\n\r\nComplementing the tennis court is an impressive collection of resort-style amenities including a wellness pavilion, gym, sauna, indoor spa, bar and beautifully landscaped grounds. Whether hosting guests, enjoying family time or pursuing an active lifestyle, the property offers a level of recreational luxury seldom found in such a prestigious residential location. \r\n\r\nThe home's thoughtfully designed accommodation includes a luxurious primary suite with dressing room, spa-inspired ensuite and magnificent views, alongside additional bedrooms, generous living zones, a temperature-controlled wine cellar and extensive eight-car drive-through garaging. \r\n\r\nHeld and enjoyed for more than two decades, this landmark estate presents a rare opportunity to secure one of Auckland's most complete lifestyle properties. Combining a coveted Paritai Drive address with an international-sized floodlit tennis court, resort-style wellness facilities and exceptional harbour views, this is a residence without equal.\r\n\r\nPrivate inspections by appointment. Enquire now. Conjunctional Agents Welcome.\r\n\r\nImportant: This property may be marketed as suitable for overseas purchasers. However, this does not constitute confirmation of eligibility, approval, or suitability for any individual buyer. All overseas purchasers remain subject to New Zealand’s overseas investment laws, including the Overseas Investment Act 2005, and may require consent from the Overseas Investment Office. You must obtain your own independent legal, financial, and technical advice and secure any necessary approvals before proceeding with a purchase.",
